# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# agent/.gitignore
# The entire agent/ folder is gitignored from the root .gitignore.
# This file is a belt-and-suspenders safety net in case the folder
# is ever accidentally included.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Ignore everything in this folder
*

# Except this file itself
!.gitignore
